>> Slurp := Oibseact ùr.

Slurp air: ['ùr'] dèan: {
	leis str := [''].
}.


Slurp air: ['freagair:'] dèan: { :blah
		(leis str = ['']) fìor: {
			leis str cuir-ris: blah.
		}, eile: {
			leis str cuir-ris: [' '].
			leis str cuir-ris: blah.
		}.
}.

Slurp air: ['freagair:agus:'] dèan: { :blah :blahah
		leis str cuir-ris: (blah bho: 0 faid: (blah faid - 1)).
		leis str cuir-ris: [' '].
		leis str cuir-ris: blahah.
}.

Slurp air: ['obtain'] dèan: {
	>> buffer := leis str.
	leis str := ['']. <- buffer.
}.


Slurp ùr hello world.
Às-chur sgrìobh: (Slurp obtain), loidhne-ùr. 
Às-chur sgrìobh: (Slurp obtain), loidhne-ùr. 
Slurp hello world.
>> x := Slurp ùr.
Às-chur sgrìobh: (x obtain), loidhne-ùr. 
x hi there.
Às-chur sgrìobh: (x obtain), loidhne-ùr. 
